| :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :---------------------------------- |
| **Software** — Natulib OS, firmware, applications, web tools, source code                                                        | [PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0](https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/) | ❌ Not permitted without permission  |
| **Hardware & Documentation** — schematics, PCB designs, 3D models, assembly instructions, growing recipes, educational materials | [CC BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/)                     | ❌ Not permitted without permission  |
| **Natulib name & logo**                                                                                                          | Reserved                                                                                  | ❌ Not granted by the above licenses |

> **The applicable license terms are those of the official licenses linked above. This document is provided as a project-level summary and does not replace the full license texts.**

